description: Architelier letters, memos, and client or city email
alwaysApply: false
---

Use `templates/correspondence.md` for letters and memos.

- Date, addressee, project address, and a `RE:` line come first
- One purpose per letter: confirm, request, or respond
- Copy municipality spelling and unit suffixes from the latest source (city, title, or consultant email)
- Mark code or accessibility statements as draft for Danny’s review unless quoting a signed Architelier document
- Close with the current Architelier signature; if the thread already has a signature, match it
- Keep the voice formal and specific; no marketing language on permit or city letters
